data: {"id": "70749d8f195b47f8-thinking-parallel_evidence-1611", "run_id": "70749d8f195b47f8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口如下：\n\n## 实体身份\n- **Pod**: `workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l`, namespace `aiops-case-09`, UID `13aa0496-5af5-4103-882f-2a096df0dc3f`\n- **容器**: `app`（单容器），镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n- **节点**: `node2` (10.2.0.50)，Pod IP `172.16.104.35`\n- **Owner**: ReplicaSet `workload-5f4fb9ff45`\n- **创建时间**: 2026-09-07T18:55:18Z\n\n## 支持 NotReady 根因的证据\n\n### 1. Readiness Probe 连续失败（直接根因）\n- **kubectl_describe** 显示 kubelet 持续报告：\n  - 早期：`Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.35:8", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788808808098, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

